      "speakerId": "84ab847b-1bad-5351-8718-5cf62bff28a4",
      "content": "오늘 승리 축하드립니다. 경기 내내 주도권을 놓치지 않았는데요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Congratulations on today's win. You never let go of the initiative.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d50f8d18-9656-5968-b429-c9a4ea5bf0b2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
